\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}4\\overset{―}{k} \\\\ (-5+\\text{i})\\overset{―}{k}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we obtain the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}4\\overset{―}{k}=-20+28\\text{i} \\\\ (-5+\\text{i})\\overset{―}{k}=18-40\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the first equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{k}=-5+7\\text{i}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the second equation, we obtain the true statement\n\n$$\n(-5+\\text{i})(-5+7\\text{i})=18-40\\text{i}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $k=\\overset{―}{-5+7\\text{i}}=-5-7\\text{i}.$\n\nFinally, $\\text{Re}(k)=-5.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041865/state.json" "file_sha256" "a9302120e50a88bb29d91cba43d547f5184d2c95789086b343ed6ba943c592d7"} {"question" "q-130894" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041865/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "f4b86640334b0f49f7977fb59639aabb6d7aff9789dae17642a4e607e693d252"} {"question" "q-130894" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041865/state.json" "file_sha256" "a9302120e50a88bb29d91cba43d547f5184d2c95789086b343ed6ba943c592d7"} {"question" "q-130894" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-2"] ["math" "-4"] ["math" "-5"] ["math" "7"] ["math" "8"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041865/state.json" "file_sha256" "a9302120e50a88bb29d91cba43d547f5184d2c95789086b343ed6ba943c592d7"} {"question" "q-130894" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-5"] "category" "ma_successful_